  (text "PCB2 TMF8829 fingertip sensor board: one sensor, local datasheet capacitors, 16-wire JST NSHD connector, DET resistor, and four small NPTH mounting holes."
    (at 12.00 12.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6c3f58d5-82f3-432b-aa69-779a55540469")
  )

  (text "Harness pinout matches PCB1 exactly. J1 pin 3 is TOF_VIO, pin 5 is P1V8_TOF, pins 2/3/5 are not interchangeable."
    (at 12.00 20.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "4c0a1b25-64d9-4f24-982a-e624a9aa3ad0")
  )

  (text "C1/C2/C3/C4 use the datasheet-listed Murata 1 uF 0402. C5 uses the datasheet-listed Murata 2.2 uF 0201 VIO capacitor."
    (at 12.00 144.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "252629a2-563c-402e-9b3d-c4d3f7cfc032")
  )

  (text "No extra sensor-side ESD arrays are placed in this compact revision; PCB1 protects the cable at the controller connector."
    (at 12.00 152.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "77de4fbd-a4a8-4725-9105-d1b6f475527c")
  )

  (text "Keep TMF8829 optical face clear of the wire bundle, mounting holes, screw heads, copper features, boot, and cover-glass occlusion."
    (at 12.00 160.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "1fe08a52-cde1-4ae2-888a-63feef209f55")
  )

